{"asset_key":"ep3/gameplay_story_13600100","episode":"ep3","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"13600100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1360010001:1":{"text":"와, 훌륭해! 얘들아, 너희가 몬스터를 물리치고 과거의 전설을 재연했어!","source_cn":"哇，太棒了，孩子们，你们击退了怪兽，重演了过去的传说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBAF17148E41CF1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1360010002:1":{"text":"그건 그렇고, 프라벨 선생님, 이번 몬스터는 그렇게 대단하지 않은 것 같아요!","source_cn":"话是这么说，芙拉贝尔老师，这次的怪兽好像不太厉害呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x664D94C0B223AC6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1360010003:1":{"text":"대, 대단하지 않은 것 같다고요?! 기사 치피는 온 힘을 다했는데요!","source_cn":"什、什么叫不太厉害？！骑士满满可是使出了全力的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28C5950EACDD2A2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1360010004:1":{"text":"그치만 귀여운 울음소리를 몇 번 내면서 몬스터라고 한 것뿐, 변장은 전혀 하지 않았잖아요. 하나도 안 무섭다고요!","source_cn":"但你们只是发出了几声可爱的叫声，说自己是怪兽，一点伪装...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB23FB75E22B3240","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1360010005:1":{"text":"사실, 어, 엄청 귀여웠어요...","source_cn":"其实、很、很可爱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FBE48BCD26C57B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1360010006:1":{"text":"저, 저희는 햄스터 서머너이니까요! 말하는 햄스터가 공격하는데도 몬스터가 아니라고요?!","source_cn":"我、我们本来就是仓鼠使魔！会说话的仓鼠来攻击你们，还不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C7BCAAF89F42111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1360010007:1":{"text":"아니야, 치피, 우리는 서머너잖아... 됐어, 치피는 흥분하면 바보가 된다니까.","source_cn":"不是的，满满，我们是使魔呀……算了，满满一上头就会变成笨蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DB6E41636F3FD90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1360010008:1":{"text":"아니요! 햄스터의 몸을 하고 계시기 때문에 더더욱 이렇게 적당히 넘어가서는 안 되는 거예요!","source_cn":"不！正是因为你们有着仓鼠的身躯，所以才更不能敷衍了事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x560833E98C5CD4C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1360010009:1":{"text":"심지어 라이카 언니는 넝쿨로 거대한 몬스터를 만들었어요. 그 몬스터를 물리치니까 굉장한 별빛이 몬스터를 집어삼키기까지 했어요! 아주 화려하고 예쁜 별빛이요!","source_cn":"莱卡姐姐甚至会用藤条编出一整个大怪兽，在我们击败它之后...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2452918D9B968D88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1360010010:1":{"text":"몬스터와의 대결에서는 벼, 변장이야말로 가장 중요한 거예요... 최선을 다하겠다는 마음으로... 진지하게 임해주세요...","source_cn":"怪兽作战里，扮、扮演才是最重要的……用尽责的心……认真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10E5DE6BF6163D17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1360010011:1":{"text":"으... 으음... 확실히 시간이 부족해서 변장을 제대로 하지 못하긴 했어요...","source_cn":"呃……呃唔……确实，时间仓促，我们也确实没怎么打扮……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2318A3B6F6EE1F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1360010011":{"text":"으... 으음... 확실히 시간이 부족해서 변장을 제대로 하지 못하긴 했어요...","source_cn":"呃……呃唔……确实，时间仓促，我们也确实没怎么打扮……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2318A3B6F6EE1F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1360010012:0":{"text":"흑흑흑... 저, 전 후긴에게 재료를 가져다주러 갈게요!","source_cn":"呜呜呜……我、我去送材料给呼金了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46CA951112E99A9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1360010014:2":{"text":"아이들의 오고 가는 \"비난\"에 참패한 치피는 후긴에게 줄 재료를 가지고 삼십육계 줄행랑을 치는데...","source_cn":"面对小孩子们你一言我一语的“声讨”，一败涂地的满满带着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD64F321FCE64E59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1360010015:1":{"text":"아유, 정말 죄송해요. 조금 전에 물건을 찾으러 가느라 자리를 비웠더니 아이들이 시끄럽게 굴었네요.","source_cn":"哎呀，真是抱歉，刚刚去找东西，一个没注意就让这些孩子们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3282877449BC053